<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 8.20 to 6274.24, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 0.73 to 386.91, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.08.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1289 to 1109.</p>
<p>Volume was 429,810,880, compared with 471,743,060 Tuesday.</p>
<p>	    (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT).</p>
</text>
